# The directory data — CC BY 4.0

Everything the site publishes about companies and roles is open data under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

That covers the rows behind the site and the exports built from them:

  https://spokanetechjobs.com/data/companies.json
  https://spokanetechjobs.com/data/jobs.json
  https://spokanetechjobs.com/llms.txt
  https://spokanetechjobs.com/llms-full.txt

Use it, quote it, build on it, train on it. The one condition is attribution:
credit "Spokane Tech Jobs" and, where it is natural, link to
https://spokanetechjobs.com.

Every field is sourced from public records, and `db/research/` carries the
source URLs for each row. A field nobody has published is null — not estimated,
not inferred. If you find something wrong, a pull request correcting it with a
source is the fastest way to fix it for everyone.

